{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37990","headline":"春阴独酌寄同年虞部李郎中 · 韩偓","name":"春阴独酌寄同年虞部李郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春阴漠漠土脉润，春寒微微风意和。\n闲嗤入甲奔竞态，醉唱落调渔樵歌。\n诗道揣量疑可进，宦情刓缺转无多。\n酒酣狂兴依然在，其奈千茎鬓雪何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37990.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37990","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}